  "description": "How To Get Started - It's Not As Complicated As You Think!",
  "body_html": "<p>Don’t be afraid of the markets. Interestingly, some people and influencers present the markets as incredibly complicated…Heck…I’ve done that too! But the more simple you make the market, the better you will do over time. </p><p>The image below is your very first step: Identifying what type of trader you are. Check out Part 1 above: “Who are you” to get started!</p><p><em><strong>Total Duration Needed To Get Through Videos: ~33 Minutes</strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6dgk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37046204-dbc2-4cd2-9d9e-6241918dc90d_960x540.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6dgk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37046204-dbc2-4cd2-9d9e-6241918dc90d_960x540.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6dgk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37046204-dbc2-4cd2-9d9e-6241918dc90d_960x540.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6dgk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37046204-dbc2-4cd2-9d9e-6241918dc90d_960x540.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6dgk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37046204-dbc2-4cd2-9d9e-6241918dc90d_960x540.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6dgk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.co