\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h1><strong>2. Choosing A Brokerage</strong></h1><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;d2b3008f-3f1a-475e-9332-5e38bb2da15d&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><p><strong>Popular Brokerages:</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.webull.com/offers-promotions/deposit?source=brand-gl-search-pc-trade&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gbraid=0AAAAABHwKJNrGA46m-ney1G27H5EOb8O5&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwoNzABhDbARIsALfY8VPsJ7e45rYS4z8VTHLCn4_R_yXcwlyNHe5P8qmPW4awLA8DhbUwwfkaAip-EALw_wcB\">Webull</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.schwab.com/stocks/stock-trading?src=SEM&amp;ef_id=Cj0KCQjwoNzABhDbARIsALfY8VOjCD5mBb-2L1vs4kpGnPeko4HkMkuzCKi400w7-RhVNI0b5e6yko0aAjq_EALw_wcB:G:s&amp;s_kwcid=AL!5158!3!736506539945!e!!g!!charles%20schwab%20trading!22175107665!178093643750&amp;keywordid=kwd-2796171021&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gbraid=0AAAAADhoFlmJKb7sIdKnP_oZqQXeS2Xhm&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwoNzABhDbARIsALfY8VOjCD5mBb-2L1vs4kpGnPeko4HkMkuzCKi400w7-RhVNI0b5e6yko0aAjq_EALw_wcB\">Charles Schwab</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.fidelity.com/trading/the-fidelity-account?imm_pid=58700008720329106&amp;immid=100734_SEA&amp;imm_eid=ep80180098932&amp;utm_source=GOOGLE&amp;utm_medium=paid_search&amp;utm_account_id=700000001008518&amp;utm_campaign=BRK&amp;utm_content=58700008720329106&amp;utm_term=fidelity+trading&amp;utm_campaign_id=100734&amp;utm_id=71700000118776385&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAD7OUhKSs6WzxPSKSoiy9UfvQll6_&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwoNzABhDbARIsALfY8VOjG7HXZRH8ppozx5NJVMb0sP9GJDdeQlvVj7zvESo-MtNljSeEe-waAhJWEALw_wcB&amp;gclsrc=aw.ds\">Fidelity</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.interactivebrokers.com/\">Interactive Brokers</a></p></li></ul><h1>3. How to buy a stock - Order Types</h1><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;c3b61033-3a1e-475b-aeb6-c63ed24e4318&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><h1>4. What Defines a “Good” Company</h1><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;957f727d-d923-4bac-8074-bc1b1cc02168&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><h1>5. Simplify Your Charts</h1><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;0b6f9f68-b7f5-440f-ae36-f8da0571afcd&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><p><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/\">You can get to TradingView by clicking here</a></p><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">You can add the trading tools mentioned in the video here</a></p><h1>6. How Much Should You buy?</h1><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;2067bd6e-6f32-492d-8e70-f8331984b011&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><p>More Information: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down\">How To Dollar Cost Average UP</a></p><h1>7. Time in the Market…or Time the Market? BOTH!</h1><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;4beedf36-034c-4322-87c0-89978eae8400&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><h1>8. Managing Your Positions</h1><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;e88e7510-d982-49f8-b3f9-d41d00a54360&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><p>More Information: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/blow-off-top-or-bull-trap?r=4z8lgl\">Example of a real trade we are managing (May 2025)</a></p><p>I believe in giving away real value upfront — and if you’ve made it this far, I hope you’ve found it worthwhile. If you’d like to go further with the final two videos, they’re available to paid subscribers. It costs a coffee for the month, that keeps this work going. Plus…we put all of this to use and much more advanced analysis in the group. Hope to have you aboard! </p><p>👇 <strong>Below the subscribe line: </strong></p><ul><li><p>How The Economy Ties Into The Stock Market </p></li><li><p>Critical Leading Indicators</p></li></ul>",
